<div style="background-color:#ED1C2B;color:#FFFFFF;padding:40px;" data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:2:61"><h1 style="text-align: center;">Support Your Neighbors In Need&nbsp;This Holiday Season</h1></div>
<div class="py-5" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-xl:3:18"></div>
<div class="my-2" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-sm:5:80"></div>
<div class="row g-3 my-3" data-zesty-id="design:columns:2columns:8:23">
<div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12 bg-area u-sa-navyBg" data-zesty-id="design:columns:2columns:8:23-1:2 Columns - Equal:0">
<h4 data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:4:9"><img class="img-fluid w-100" src="https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/956faefd-273d-4f08-96fc-281bf39d330c_give-bellringer.png"></h4>

<h6>Register to Ring</h6>

<p>
	Help make Christmas bright by volunteering to ring a bell at a Salvation Army Red Kettle. Your time ringing will help people in need in your community.
</p>

<p>
	<a href="https://www.registertoring.com/"><span class="btn btn-solid btn-red btn-white">Register to Ring</span></a>
</p>
				</div>
<div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12 bg-area u-sa-navyBg" data-zesty-id="design:columns:2columns:8:23-1:2 Columns - Equal:1">
<h6 data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:6:28"><img class="img-fluid w-100" src="https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/a7120abd-d524-4a78-99ba-2df578ad8c03_give-angel-tree.jpg"></h6>

<h6>Angel Tree</h6>

<p>
	Share your gift of love with a child in need this Christmas. Adopt an Angel from one of The Salvation Army's Angel Trees in your community.
</p>

<p>
	<a href="mailto:Rosa.Portillo@uss.salvationarmy.org"><span class="btn btn-solid btn-red">Contact Us</span></a>
</p>
				</div>
			</div>
<div class="my-2" data-zesty-id="design:design:whitespace-sm:10:24"></div>
<div class="row g-3 my-3" data-zesty-id="design:columns:2columns:13:40">
<div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12 bg-area u-sa-navyBg" data-zesty-id="design:columns:2columns:13:40-1:2 Columns - Equal:0">
<h5 data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:9:44"><img class="img-fluid w-100" src="https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/ca17d5df-9021-4e9b-bbab-c4e661e73dd0_give-vrk.png"></h5>

<h6>Virtual Red Kettle</h6>

<p>
	The Virtual Red Kettle is as close as your phone, tablet, or computer. It's a convenient&nbsp;way to make a difference this holiday season.
</p>

<p>
	<a href="https://give.salvationarmycarolinas.org/campaign/731671/donate" target="_blank"><span class="btn btn-solid btn-red">Visit Our Red Kettle</span></a>
</p>
				</div>
<div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 col-sm-12 bg-area u-sa-navyBg" data-zesty-id="design:columns:2columns:13:40-1:2 Columns - Equal:1">
<h5 data-zesty-id="content:wysiwyg_basic:11:56"><img class="img-fluid w-100" src="https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/99288499-e135-48f2-ba4f-f91eac5d99f2_give-kettle.png"></h5>

<h6>Red Kettle Campaign</h6>

<p>
	Help our neighbors in need this holiday season by giving to The Salvation Army Red Kettle. Every dollar dropped into a Red Kettle provides year-round&nbsp;support to local families and individuals.
</p>

<p>
	<a href="https://www.salvationarmyusa.org/usn/red-kettle-history/"><span class="btn btn-solid btn-red">History of the Red Kettle</span></a>
</p>
